    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Combine any two cards to trigger AI-generated stories and items.&quot;<br><br>\u258c Core Experience: AI Real-time Narrative Engine</strong><br>Every card combination triggers the AI to generate unique items and storylines. Unbound by pre-programmed code, anything in your imagination can become a tool for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c First Scenario: Desert Island Survival</strong><br>Put your common sense to the test! Survive hunger, wild beasts, diseases, and unexpected threats born from the AI's whims on this unforgiving island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c Roadmap: More Scenarios &amp; Advanced AI Architecture</strong><br>Infinite possibilities through AI generation! Future updates will bring diverse scenarios like band management and modern warfare, powered by continuously evolving AI systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c The Grand Vision: Scenario Editor</strong><br>Why limit creation to developers? Our built-in Scenario Editor will empower every player to craft their own haunting narratives.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Combine any two cards to trigger AI-generated stories and items.&quot;<br><br>\u258c Core Experience: AI Real-time Narrative Engine</strong><br>Every card combination triggers the AI to generate unique items and storylines. Unbound by pre-programmed code, anything in your imagination can become a tool for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c First Scenario: Desert Island Survival</strong><br>Put your common sense to the test! Survive hunger, wild beasts, diseases, and unexpected threats born from the AI's whims on this unforgiving island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c Roadmap: More Scenarios &amp; Advanced AI Architecture</strong><br>Infinite possibilities through AI generation! Future updates will bring diverse scenarios like band management and modern warfare, powered by continuously evolving AI systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u258c The Grand Vision: Scenario Editor</strong><br>Why limit creation to developers? Our built-in Scenario Editor will empower every player to craft their own haunting narratives.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this innovative AI-driven card sandbox game, every card represents your tools, emotions, or any concept you can imagine. Combine cards through drag-and-drop interactions \u2013AI generates stories and outcomes in real time. Every action you take dynamically reshapes the trajectory of your fate.",
